3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-eb251c3684f5d6f2END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-6e5c82b941422145END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_UND_NightsongBook</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_UND_NightsongBook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_UND_NightsongBook\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">03ddecea-d7db-4fda-803b-5c81a0f3493b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:03ddecea-d7db-4fda-803b-5c81a0f3493b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:03ddecea-d7db-4fda-803b-5c81a0f3493b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Base of the <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne\" title=\"Selûne\">Selûne</a> statue in <a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBnite_Outpost\" title=\"Selûnite Outpost\">Selûnite Outpost</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;155&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-232</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Fascinating that such a seemingly valuable object has proven so difficult to track down. Indeed, treasure-\nhunters the realm over have travelled to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sword_Coast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sword Coast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Sword_Coast\">Sword Coast</a></span> with one goal in mind: To find the Nightsong. Yet each by each they have failed, indicating dead ends, rebuffs, or else disappearing altogether.\n</p><p><br>\nMy latest enquiry was with a <a href=\"/wiki/Half-orc\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Half-orc\">half-orc</a> named Graly, who insisted he'd come as close as possible to the relic as one may go without forfeiting his or her life. He indicated that the object is not, as most reports indicate, in the Selûnite fort adjacent to the river <a href=\"/wiki/Chionthar\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Chionthar\">Chionthar</a>. It is, in fact, held in an old <a href=\"/wiki/Shar\" title=\"Shar\">Sharran</a> fortress somewhere in the environs of <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a>. However, Graly reported that some kind of potent shadow prevents one from approaching where this fortress might be.\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading this book advances the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Nightsong\" title=\"Find the Nightsong\">Find the Nightsong</a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201135\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.056 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.059 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1776/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 33212/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11651/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931362/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   46.734      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   46.734      1 -total\n 58.13%   27.166      7 Template:Icon_text\n 53.31%   24.914     19 Template:Trim\n 37.34%   17.452      1 Template:PageSeo\n 37.19%   17.379      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 25.65%   11.987      3 Template:Icon_link\n 21.98%   10.274      1 Template:CharLink\n 21.06%    9.841      2 Template:Uid\n 20.37%    9.519      7 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27001-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201135 and revision id 285676. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}